{
  "key": "letter-066-part-01",
  "number": 66,
  "generationId": "01a1e5b9-4dba-7f17-b721-4c01e831627e",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.61576
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I received your letter on my return.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.912766,
      "end": 3.840499
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Just as the seed within the soil waits for the rains so you wait for God.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.369229,
      "end": 9.690045
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Prayerful, wholehearted surrender is the door leading to him.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.081519,
      "end": 14.525350999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Let yourself go completely, just like a boat floating on the river.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.847574000000002,
      "end": 19.654467
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "You do not have to row the boat, just let it go loose.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/06.mp3",
      "start": 21.115261,
      "end": 24.378753
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "You are not to swim, just to float, then the river itself takes you to the ocean.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/07.mp3",
      "start": 25.815896,
      "end": 30.982653000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The ocean is very near - but only for those who float but do not swim.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/08.mp3",
      "start": 32.507166000000005,
      "end": 37.005578
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Do not be afraid of drowning because that fear makes you swim - and the truth is that he who drowns himself in God is saved forever.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/09.mp3",
      "start": 38.46746,
      "end": 48.083855
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "And do not have a goal, for he who has a goal begins to swim.",
      "path": "audio/1969-66/10.mp3",
      "start": 49.671701000000006,
      "end": 54.94
    }
  ]
}
